# --- parsing edge cases ---
# Bare CEF without a syslog header (no program_name).
# expect: decoder=ubiquiti fields=event.id,event.name,event.severity,src
CEF:0|Ubiquiti|UniFi Network|10.6.106|544|Admin Accessed UniFi Network|1|UNIFIcategory=System src=198.51.100.7 msg=test
# Syslog header with an explicit program name.
# expect: decoder=ubiquiti fields=event.id,src
Oct 10 16:00:00 UDM-Pro unifi: CEF:0|Ubiquiti|UniFi Network|10.6.106|544|Admin Accessed UniFi Network|1|src=198.51.100.7 msg=test
# Two-digit CEF severity.
# expect: decoder=ubiquiti rule=100390 level=12 fields=event.severity
Oct 10 16:00:00 UDM-Pro CEF:0|Ubiquiti|UniFi Network|10.6.106|909|Synthetic Severity Ten|10|UNIFIcategory=System msg=x

